<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-19T22:20:49.950Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:20:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army is pushing into RSF strongholds in West Kordofan and the Blue Nile while RSF drone attacks have killed at least 1,630 civilians at markets, hospitals and fuel sites, prompting Amnesty International to call for war crimes investigations into attacks on El Obeid. Courts have sentenced RSF chief Hemedti and 13 others to death in absentia, and a separate court also sentenced the head of the RSF to death in absentia. RSF commanders and troops are defecting to join the Sudanese army, and external powers supplying drones and technology are being held responsible for civilian deaths, including those of human rights defenders. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQemNHWDV6ZlRZS0pBb3djbVRjMjFtci1sZ1VsSS0ySThHQUVlN2dHSmVCenZkd0xPWnJTUFowUldsckFzR2lBUzNCd0ladGg0bWZKQVBiMWpwNXJZc0hsZXRfekJDT2k1aXdSVzJockgzTHplRWlUcDNfRGRCakdqOG5tVW05TzJTOGxIRnd0YThqQXFaVzQ1ckE4TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQNFNPd0hZWkhlVmJra3UxQVJyUHNNbW5WM0pCZFhUb09paGtLaTFPUld6SHctV1otZllHMDRGN1JKbzEyYmdDUGJFUmpEZjRyUUpNV1l5TWxxWGhCZ2RaeEliQ0xfSldTdzhSYkxZLXQ4S0J3dzVvcUhRcG5VVUJmSzg2SlI3MGlocGMtVS10M0xtOXNYQ2RfOUdqdEo1aXVmSWF4Si1QbzJDeW82?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Tamazuj&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE9udHVmaTJVWWhGVGF4VUZMN0Y3dEJpMTdHaG9DOWhZeXFRVWVxRGYtV1M0NlhNUFRsZVFmam9YYmxkZmR3b283M3BKb0h4U0Vqb2N2aQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yemen Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nilepost&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxPN051QktueFpkTkJJQ1h5NG5RWW5vRzYwUExtRjF2SldId204dUlGYTVON2VpV0dmYTZ6Zkkt